# Branding studio

Additive to [design-system.mdc](design-system.mdc) / Aurora. Organiser chrome stays indigo/slate; event brand colour is for public/email surfaces only. Do not mix Ministerial (ink/stone/bronze).

## Studio UX

- Dense controls studio (not sparse marketing layouts).
- Pill tabs: **Identity · Page banner · Invite hero · Typography**.
- Sticky live preview; sticky save bar; Desktop | Mobile preview toggle.
- Unsaved dirty state + Cmd/Ctrl+S; warn on unload when dirty.
- “More options” disclosures for advanced controls — keep primary controls uncluttered.
- Fade/indigo `Slider` track (see `slider.tsx`); no sample/shortcut chip clutter on type controls.
- Success/error via **toasts/dialogs only** — never inline page notice/error copy.
- No decorative page/section eyebrows (no `PageHeader` eyebrow; no uppercase eyebrow chrome above sections). Keep necessary form `FieldsetLabel`s.
- “Send me a preview” email only after save (disabled while dirty).

## Typography

- Canva-style: font dropdowns + numeric size field; size slider under More options.
- Medium/Semibold must match live preview **and** invite-hero PNG — real weight TTFs in `assets/fonts/invite-hero/`.
- Under More options: text align, line height, eyebrow uppercase toggle.
- Counters: Title ≤160 (`HERO_TITLE_MAX`), Eyebrow ≤120 (`HERO_EYEBROW_MAX`).

## Photo / colours

- Page banner (`emailBannerUrl`) and invitation hero source photo (`emailHeroPhotoUrl`) are **separate uploads** — do not share one image field. `emailHeroImageUrl` is the composed PNG cache only.
- Drag-and-drop upload onto banner/hero frame; independent local previews; focal pan + Zoom 100–200% per surface.
- Low-res warning when photo width < ~1200px (`PHOTO_MIN_RECOMMENDED_WIDTH`).
- Invite-hero overlay darkness slider; contrast warning + one-click heading fix vs backdrop.
- Suggest colours from uploaded logo; recent custom colours row (localStorage OK).

## Invitation email body

- `emailInviteHighlights` — newline-separated bullet insights in the HTML invitation body (under the greeting). Max 8 lines × 120 chars.
- Separate from `emailHeroDetail` (hero PNG copy only). Empty highlights keep the short invite body.

## Email truth

Invitation hero PNG is source of truth for the top graphic; HTML body highlights are separate. Keep live preview visually close to the rendered PNG.
